WEBVTT

00:01.080 --> 00:01.840
I am

00:01.920 --> 00:03.320
I was forced

00:03.400 --> 00:05.320
Since it was Chu Huan's plan

00:05.400 --> 00:06.640
Elder brother

00:06.720 --> 00:08.387
You can release me, right?

00:12.160 --> 00:13.120
Second son

00:13.200 --> 00:15.960
You truly are qualified imperial material

00:16.720 --> 00:18.080
Your own brother

00:18.320 --> 00:19.680
Abandoned without hesitation

00:20.160 --> 00:21.400
In this

00:21.480 --> 00:22.760
I am not as good as you

00:22.840 --> 00:24.040
However

00:24.120 --> 00:25.800
I should learn

00:27.800 --> 00:29.200
Prince of Ning
